    "directions": [
      "In a handi, add oil, once it's hot, add small mustard seeds, cumin seeds, curry leaves and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onion and saute it for 2-4 minutes on medium flame until translucent. Add ginger garlic paste and saute it well for a while.",
      "Add turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder, tomatoes, green chillies and saute it on medium flame.",
      "Add water, salt to taste and let it cook for 4-5 minutes.",
      "Finish it with coriander leaves and keep it aside for further use..",
      "In a bowl, add eggs, salt to taste, oil and whisk it well.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, pour the mixture and make a thin omelet.",
      "Transfer it to a plate and keep it aside for further use.",
      "Place the prepared omelette, add prepared masala, grated cheese and boiled egg.",
      "Add prepared masala and seal it from all the sides.",
      "Run the banana leaf on fire for 2-3 seconds to make it soft and moldable.",
      "Take a big piece of wilted banana leaf, add a tablespoon of the prepared masala in the center.",
      "Place the omelette on it, place the sliced tomatoes, green chillies, add a pinch of degi red chilli powder and salt to taste.",
      "Fold the banana leaf to make a small pocket.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, place the prepared pocket and cook it for 5 minutes on a low flame from both the sides."
    ],
